  "prompt": "The finance team wants the clearance and bundle promotions that gave 15 percent off or more. From the promotions table, return three columns, in this order: promo_code, promo_type, discount_pct. Keep only the promotions whose promo_type is clearance or bundle and whose discount_pct is 15 or more. Every promotion has a promo_type and a discount_pct. Show discount_pct exactly as stored, without rounding. Return one row per promotion. Any row order is fine.",
